    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Prime property to come to market comprising former Greyhound Puppy Rearing Farm with outbuildings altogether standing on c. 10.97 Acres, fronting onto two roads holding huge potential for previous or new enterprise due to location between the towns of Roscommon and Ballyleague/Lanesboro and centrally located in Ireland.\nThe Farm comprises a modern building with a Gross Internal Square Area of c. 230 sq. metres (c. 14 ft Eave) set out into three sections with roller door to front section and doors to store, toilet and kennels.\nAdjoining the building are three covered dog runs with three additional uncovered dog runs adjacent. With 16 dog paddocks of different sizes all serviced by roadways, this property provides an ideal opportunity for those interested in acquiring a specialist former greyhound/equine/canine property. Mains water connection and electricity are not connected.\nIn need of minor works to return to its previous condition, the auctioneer invites enquiries and offers for immediate sale.\nFor further details, contact DNG Ivan Connaughton on 090-6663700."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Ivan Connaughton"
      }
